## Job description
At Youwe, we help organizations successfully implement digital platforms that connect systems, data, and business processes. As a Senior Consultant, you bridge business needs and technical execution, translating client requirements into scalable solutions that support long-term success. Working closely with internal and external stakeholders, you guide implementations from discovery to delivery, ensuring every solution is aligned with business objectives and technical requirements.
From solution design to implementation and optimization, you ensure projects are delivered efficiently, adopted successfully, and create measurable value for clients.
### **Key Responsibilities**
* Lead workshops to capture business requirements and translate them into scalable solutions;
* Advise on Pimcore (PIM, DAM, MDM) and data architecture implementations;
