* Challenge assumptions to ensure long-term, sustainable solutions;
* From pre-sales to go-live, maintain quality and continuity across projects.
## Job requirements
* 5+ years of experience as an Implementation or Business Consultant, preferably in a digital agency;
* Hands-on experience with Pimcore or similar enterprise platforms;
* Strong understanding of APIs, integrations, and system architecture;
* Solid knowledge of data governance and migrations;
* Understanding of generative AI, semantic search/embeddings and agentic PXM concepts.
